t me stay at her house.</span><br><span class=\"bullet\">I missed my flight to Boston. </span><br><br>Some past verb forms are irregular. They do not end in -ed.  <br><br>Here is a list of irregular verbs. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"arise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"arose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"break\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"broke\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was / were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"become\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"became\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write an 8-10 line dialogue between you and your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include questions like <span class=\"italic\">When did you arrive home?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe activities he/she did during his/her trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue to convey activities I like to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions in a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe things in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about activities with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Sally ... you world traveler!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi! I missed you. Sally's Suitcase is back home!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am so excited to see you. I've waited for months.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Yeah."}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "11000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: When are we catching up?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Aren't you still in San Francisco?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I'm staying with my Aunt Nelly and studying at the Blue Ribbon Academy."}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "19500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Didn't you rent an apartment?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, she kindly offered to let me stay with her.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "25000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's nice of her. I mentioned to Peter that you and I might go to the Grand Canyon in a couple weeks. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You haven't  booked it yet?<br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "33000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Actually, I forgot. I am planning to do it today.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmmmm ... You didn't remember to make reservations? <br>"}, {"image": "engenn4le13ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 6, "time": "41500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sorry, I wanted to take this trip to the Grand Canyon last year.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm booking things in the future."}], "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob0